  "notes": "{切|き}れる is an intransitive ichidan verb meaning to be cut, run out, or snap.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- {自動詞|じどうし}: {切|き}れる (to be cut, break, run out)\n- {他動詞|たどうし}: {切|き}る (to cut)\n\nSENSE 1 (be cut/break):\n- {糸|いと}が{切|き}れる: thread breaks\n- ロープが{切|き}れる: rope breaks\n- よく{切|き}れる: cuts well (sharpness)\n\nSENSE 2 (run out/expire):\n- {電池|でんち}が{切|き}れる: battery dies\n- {期限|きげん}が{切|き}れる: deadline expires\n- {息|いき}が{切|き}れる: out of breath\n- {在庫|ざいこ}が{切|き}れる: out of stock\n\nSENSE 3 (snap/lose temper):\n- {彼|かれ}は{切|き}れた: he snapped (colloquial)\n- {切|き}れやすい: quick to snap/get angry\n\nIDIOMS:\n- {縁|えん}が{切|き}れる: to cut ties\n- {連絡|れんらく}が{切|き}れる: to lose contact",
